---
description: Core boundaries
alwaysApply: true
---

- Never edit core/ or harness paths in a feature PR (guard-core hook, check-core).
- A module touches only its own schema; other modules only via ctx.modules (per-module DB role in tests).
- Declare every read, write and call in module.json; the data-flow map must stay green (check-data-flow).
- All DB access via ctx.db; no raw database clients in modules (lint, check-data-flow).
- Identity via ctx.auth.currentMember() (lint).
- No real household data or secrets anywhere, incl. PR bodies and run records (check-secrets).
- UI copy de-DE; code, docs, commits English (reviewer).
